            "display_dots": true,
            "author_1": "Ryan S. - CCW Instructor",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/image_6.webp",
            "text_1": "<p>I've worn the Ridgeline 2.0 hunting elk in Colorado and on long-haul rides — it sits flat under my pack straps and pulls clean every time. The only chest rig I'll trust in the backcountry.</p>",
            "author_2": "",
            "text_2": "",
            "author_3": "",
            "text_3": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 24
          }
        },
        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Still Have Questions?",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "mail",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Not sure if the Ridgeline 2.0 fits your gun or your build? Email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@southedc.store\">support@southedc.store</a> — we'll help you pick the right setup before you buy.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_yMkFYj": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Features",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>A chest holster built for the people who actually move — hikers, hunters, ATV riders, ranchers, and anyone whose belt is already taken by a pack hip belt.</strong></p><ul><li>Wide 2\" nylon straps distribute weight evenly across both shoulders — no hotspots after a 10-mile day</li><li>Pack-compatible: rides cleanly under and around backpack hip belts, fanny packs, and chest rigs</li><li>Adjustable retention — dial in a clean, audible draw without compromising security</li><li>Ambidextrous design — works for right or left-hand draw out of the box</li><li>Optional integrated mag holder — choose No Mag or With Mag at checkout</li><li>Universal harness fit — adjusts to chest sizes from ~35\" to ~55\"</li><li>Works under a jacket, sweatshirt, or open-carry in the backcountry</li><li>30-day risk-free money back guarantee</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_xaD8cE": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & Delivery",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>FREE U.S. shipping on every order.</strong></p><ul><li>Order processing: 1–2 business days</li><li>Standard U.S. delivery: 3–7 business days after dispatch</li><li>Tracking emailed as soon as your holster leaves the warehouse</li><li>Shipped from the U.S.A.</li></ul><p>Questions about your order? Email <a href=\"mailto:support@southedc.store\">support@southedc.store</a> — we reply within one business day.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
