    "image_with_text_XnQVmK": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_DnQRTn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "CARRY WHERE THE BELT WON'T REACH",
            "title_highlight_color": "#6d388b",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_LdjzxU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Your belt is already loaded with a pack hip belt, a tool belt, or layered under winter gear — and the holster you trust at home gets in the way. The Ridgeline 2.0 moves the gun up to your chest where it's actually accessible: under a jacket, over a shirt, beside a backpack strap. Wide 2\" straps pull the weight off your hip and spread it across both shoulders, so you can hike all day, ride all afternoon, or drive cross-country without the holster fighting you.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
