    "55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "\"Doesn't fight my backpack\"",
            "text": "<p>I've worn this on every hunt this season — sits flat under my pack hip belt, doesn't print under my puffy, and the draw is clean every time. Best chest rig I've owned.</p>",
            "author": "Travis K."
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "\"Comfortable enough I forget I'm wearing it\"",
            "text": "<p>I ride a side-by-side a lot and the belt holster was driving me crazy bouncing around. Ridgeline rides chest-level, doesn't move, doesn't squeak. Did 8 hours yesterday and barely noticed it.</p>",
            "author": "Marcus L."
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Perfect for layering season.",
            "text": "<p>Got this for winter carry when my belt is buried under a coat. Pulls cleanly under a zip-up sweater and the straps are wide enough that I'm not getting shoulder pinch after a long day. Already telling my buddies.</p>",
            "author": "Eric M."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-1",
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-2",
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-3"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "display_id": false,
        "visibility": "always-display",
