    "collapsible_content_pH4gBH": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_Ek4ejb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will the Ridgeline 2.0 work with a backpack or hip belt?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The Ridgeline 2.0 was designed around modern pack harnesses — the wide 2\" straps ride above your pack's hip belt and sit cleanly under shoulder straps. Hikers, hunters, and rucking carriers wear it daily without conflict.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YBMXqj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What chest size does the harness fit?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The harness adjusts to fit chest sizes from approximately 35\" to 55\" — one universal harness covers most adult builds. Strap your normal t-shirt size as a starting point.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DrfwEw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it ambidextrous?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The Ridgeline 2.0 ships ambidextrous out of the box — switch between right-hand and left-hand draw without any extra hardware or a second purchase.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Kc8eLN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it work under a jacket or sweatshirt?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — chest carry is purpose-built for layering. The Ridgeline 2.0 sits flat against your shirt and pulls cleanly under a zip-up, puffy, button-down, or jacket. Perfect for winter and shoulder-season carry.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_THYzTb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it compatible with red dots, suppressor sights, or threaded barrels?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The shell is cut to accommodate red dots, suppressor-height (taller) sights, and most flush or threaded barrels. Light-bearing setups are not currently supported.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LhdeUm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I adjust the retention?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Retention is adjustable — tune it tighter for active carry (riding, hunting on horseback) or looser for a faster draw at the range. Your firearm will audibly \"click\" into place at any setting.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TYW7pT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it shift around when I'm moving?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No. Wide 2\" straps and rotating connection points keep the holster locked against your chest as you bend, twist, ride, or climb. The harness moves with you, not against you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_eGxyQV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I carry while driving or seated?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — chest carry is one of the most comfortable seated carry options. Unlike a hip holster that digs into your side every time you sit, the Ridgeline 2.0 sits flat against your chest with full access while belted in.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jViWGx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I clean the harness?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Hand wash the harness in warm soapy water and hang to dry. Do not machine wash. The shell wipes clean with a damp cloth — no special care needed.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AdDkFi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I return it if it doesn't work for me?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. We offer a 30-day risk-free return policy. If the Ridgeline 2.0 doesn't meet your expectations, email <a href=\"mailto:support@southedc.store\">support@southedc.store</a> within 30 days of receiving it. Return the item in original condition and we'll issue a full refund on the product. Shipping costs are non-refundable.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
